"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[50100],{50100:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/meditation-murder.png\\"\\n          title=\\"Mindfulness Murder\\"\\n          author=\\"Karsten Dusse\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Segyesa\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2021-07-05\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9788933871645\\"\\n          rating=3.5\\n          tags=\\"thriller\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nWhen I first encountered the title, I thought it was about murdering someone remotely through meditation.  \\nIt was ```Mindfulness Murder```, where one commits a murder and then coolly overcomes the crisis through <mark>meditation</mark>.  \\nOf course, it might have been because of <mark>meditation</mark> that the case started.  \\n<br>\\nThe last scene seems like a scene that leaves room for the next season.  \\n<br>\\nFrom the beginning, it felt like a novel made with visualization in mind.  \\nIt definitely feels like a US drama, and it seems like a subject matter that would be interesting even if visualized.\\n"}')}}]);